        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David McClelland, Henry Murray\n- Concepts: Need for power (nPow), psychological human needs, motivational processes\n- Organizations: Harvard University\n\nFacts:\n- In 1938, Henry Murray first identified underlying psychological human needs and motivational processes.\n- Henry Alexander Murray (May 13, 1893 – June 23, 1988) was an American psychologist at Harvard University.\n- In 1961, psychologist David McClelland popularized the term need for power (nPow).\n- David McClelland's thinking on need for power was influenced by Henry Murray's work.",
